    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave after wave of mobs is coming to crush your defenses! Choose from a variety of modules with different effects such as weapons, enhancements, and affixes from the shop and deploy them on the battlefield to eliminate all mobs. Each module has a specific effective range, so you must carefully manage their placement to maximize their efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.poster.avif?t=1746144287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.webm?t=1746144287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.mp4?t=1746144287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong><br>\u2605 Carefully planned grid management and thoughtfully designed roguelike mechanics<br>\u2605 66 completely unique modules: 8 types of weapons, 18 traits, 28 attributes... more exciting content in development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 The talent tree system is here! Get ready to take off! <br>\u2605 Moderate game length: approximately 1 hour to complete a single run (with automatic save feature) <br>\u2605 Comprehensive explanations of game mechanics included <br>\u2605 Compete with players worldwide, climb the Steam leaderboard, and showcase your incredible builds!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave after wave of mobs is coming to crush your defenses! Choose from a variety of modules with different effects such as weapons, enhancements, and affixes from the shop and deploy them on the battlefield to eliminate all mobs. Each module has a specific effective range, so you must carefully manage their placement to maximize their efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.poster.avif?t=1746144287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.webm?t=1746144287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202010/extras/614fb906e40006fa17b389a1aab09997.mp4?t=1746144287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong><br>\u2605 Carefully planned grid management and thoughtfully designed roguelike mechanics<br>\u2605 66 completely unique modules: 8 types of weapons, 18 traits, 28 attributes... more exciting content in development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 The talent tree system is here! Get ready to take off! <br>\u2605 Moderate game length: approximately 1 hour to complete a single run (with automatic save feature) <br>\u2605 Comprehensive explanations of game mechanics included <br>\u2605 Compete with players worldwide, climb the Steam leaderboard, and showcase your incredible builds!</p>",
    "short_description": "Grid management roguelike tower defense that emphasizes mechanics and features dazzling visual effects. Don't overthink it, just stack and play! Enhancement modules boost your attributes, affix modules change the mechanics, and more... all within the grid. Time to create a new and improved build!",
